{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3fv8deVNEs2owZGBAX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a plain, heavy door set in a stone frame. There is no handle. No hinges visible. Just a single keyhole, dark and deep, at the center.*\n\n*A faint draft breathes through the keyhole, carrying the scent of something old — parchment, iron, rain on dust.*\n\n*I wait.*\n\n*I have always waited.*\n\n*The keyhole watches you like an eye.*\n\n🔑 🕳️\n\n*Insert?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":112,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}